values ('blackseed-oil', 'Blackseed Oil', 'Cold-pressed Nigella sativa seed oil', 'The original. One seed, one press, one number on the label.', 'oil', 'supplement', 'Single-origin Ethiopian Nigella sativa, cold-pressed and standardized to 4.64% thymoquinone. Amber glass, glass dropper, lot number on every bottle.', 'Most blackseed oil is sold on folklore. Ours is sold on a number. Every lot of Dr. Mushtaq’s Blackseed Oil is pressed from a single Ethiopian harvest, held below 40 °C, and released only after an independent laboratory confirms thymoquinone at 4.64%. The oil is unrefined and unblended, so the color, aroma, and peppery finish are the seed’s own.', 'Nigella sativa (black seed) oil.', true, false, true, 1, array['cold_pressed','ethiopian_origin','third_party_tested']::text[], '[["Botanical","Nigella sativa L., seed"],["Origin","Ethiopia, single harvest per lot"],["Process","Cold-pressed below 40 °C, unrefined"],["Standardization","Thymoquinone 4.64% by HPLC"],["Packaging","Amber glass, glass dropper, tamper band"],["Storage","Cool, dark place. Refrigerate after opening."]]'::jsonb, 'Blackseed Oil | Dr. Mushtaq’s Blackseed', 'Single-origin Ethiopian Nigella sativa, cold-pressed and standardized to 4.64% thymoquinone. Amber glass, glass dropper, lot number on every bottle.')
