values ('blackseed-oil-softgels', 'Blackseed Oil Softgels', '90 softgels · 500 mg', 'The same oil, measured.', 'softgel', 'supplement', 'Our 4.64% thymoquinone oil, 500 mg per softgel, for people who want the measure without the taste. Ninety softgels per amber bottle.', 'The softgel exists for one reason: not everyone wants to taste blackseed oil every morning. Each softgel carries 500 mg of the same lot-tested, cold-pressed Ethiopian oil that goes into the dropper bottle, sealed in a shell that protects it from light and air until you take it.', 'Nigella sativa (black seed) oil. Softgel shell: bovine gelatin (halal), glycerin, purified water.', true, false, true, 2, array['cold_pressed','ethiopian_origin','third_party_tested']::text[], '[["Count","90 softgels"],["Fill","500 mg Nigella sativa seed oil per softgel"],["Standardization","Thymoquinone 4.64% by HPLC (oil fill)"],["Shell","Halal bovine gelatin, glycerin, water"],["Free from","Fillers, flow agents, artificial colors"],["Packaging","Amber glass, induction seal, desiccant"]]'::jsonb, 'Blackseed Oil Softgels | Dr. Mushtaq’s Blackseed', 'Our 4.64% thymoquinone oil, 500 mg per softgel, for people who want the measure without the taste. Ninety softgels per amber bottle.')
