values ('blackseed-balm', 'Blackseed Balm', 'Concentrated skin salve · 50 mL', 'A dense, slow-melting salve for dry places.', 'topical', 'cosmetic', 'Blackseed oil folded into beeswax, shea, and jojoba. A rich, anhydrous balm for hands, elbows, heels, cuticles, and anywhere skin runs dry.', 'The balm is our oil in its most patient form. Beeswax and shea slow it down so it stays where you put it; jojoba carries it in. There is no water, so there is no need for preservatives, and no fragrance beyond the seed’s own warm, peppery note.', 'Butyrospermum parkii (shea) butter, Simmondsia chinensis (jojoba) seed oil, Cera alba (beeswax), Nigella sativa (black seed) oil, Tocopherol (vitamin E).', true, false, true, 3, array['cold_pressed','ethiopian_origin','third_party_tested']::text[], '[["Format","Anhydrous balm"],["Net contents","50 mL / 1.7 fl oz"],["Blackseed oil","Thymoquinone-standardized 4.64% oil"],["Fragrance","None added"],["Water","None; no preservatives required"],["Packaging","Amber glass jar, black ribbed cap"]]'::jsonb, 'Blackseed Balm | Dr. Mushtaq’s Blackseed', 'Blackseed oil folded into beeswax, shea, and jojoba. A rich, anhydrous balm for hands, elbows, heels, cuticles, and anywhere skin runs dry.')
