values ('scalp-beard-serum', 'Scalp & Beard Serum', 'Blackseed · Rosemary · 60 mL', 'Light enough for the scalp, rich enough for the beard.', 'hair', 'cosmetic', 'Our blackseed oil cut with jojoba and grapeseed and finished with rosemary leaf oil. A fast-absorbing conditioning serum for scalp, beard, and the skin beneath.', 'A grooming oil has two jobs: condition the hair and leave the skin under it calm. Jojoba mirrors the skin’s own sebum, grapeseed keeps the texture light, blackseed brings its warm aroma, and rosemary gives the finish its clean herbal lift. It absorbs without a film and does not weigh fine hair down.', 'Simmondsia chinensis (jojoba) seed oil, Vitis vinifera (grape) seed oil, Nigella sativa (black seed) oil, Rosmarinus officinalis (rosemary) leaf oil, Tocopherol (vitamin E).', true, false, true, 4, array['cold_pressed','ethiopian_origin','third_party_tested']::text[], '[["Format","Leave-on oil serum"],["Net contents","60 mL / 2 fl oz"],["Blackseed oil","Thymoquinone-standardized 4.64% oil"],["Aroma","Rosemary leaf oil and the seed’s own note; no synthetic fragrance"],["Finish","Dry, non-greasy"],["Packaging","Amber glass, glass dropper"]]'::jsonb, 'Scalp & Beard Serum | Dr. Mushtaq’s Blackseed', 'Our blackseed oil cut with jojoba and grapeseed and finished with rosemary leaf oil. A fast-absorbing conditioning serum for scalp, beard, and the skin beneath.')
