values ('culinary-finishing-oil', 'Culinary Finishing Oil', 'Cold-pressed blackseed · 250 mL', 'Peppery, warm, meant to be tasted.', 'culinary', 'food', 'The same cold-pressed Ethiopian oil in a kitchen bottle with a gold pour spout. Finish lentils, flatbreads, labneh, roasted vegetables, and eggs.', 'Blackseed has been a pantry oil for far longer than it has been a supplement. This is the pressing we are proudest of, in a 250 mL bottle made to live beside your olive oil. It is not for frying. A thin thread over a finished plate is where it belongs: on hummus, over dal, into a yogurt dip, across warm bread.', 'Nigella sativa (black seed) oil.', true, false, true, 5, array['cold_pressed','ethiopian_origin','third_party_tested']::text[], '[["Use","Finishing oil; do not heat"],["Net contents","250 mL / 8.4 fl oz"],["Origin","Ethiopia, single harvest per lot"],["Process","Cold-pressed below 40 °C, unrefined"],["Flavor","Peppery, warm, faint oregano and cumin"],["Packaging","Amber glass, stainless pour spout"]]'::jsonb, 'Culinary Finishing Oil | Dr. Mushtaq’s Blackseed', 'The same cold-pressed Ethiopian oil in a kitchen bottle with a gold pour spout. Finish lentils, flatbreads, labneh, roasted vegetables, and eggs.')
